{%- comment -%} stage_profile — FIXED-metre silhouette + category climbs. The viewBox is
  split: the TOP third is reserved for the climb-category circles (so their numbers stay
  big + legible) and the BOTTOM two-thirds holds the elevation silhouette. Marker size
  scales with circ (circle radius) + cfont (number font), in viewBox units. fixedw renders
  an exact pixel width (h ≈ fixedw/2.63 keeps circles round); else fills container width.
  params: path, climbs, h, fixedw, circ, cfont {%- endcomment -%}
{% template stage_profile %}
  {% assign sw = fixedw | default: 0 %}
  {% assign cr = circ | default: 3.9 %}
  {% assign cf = cfont | default: 4.4 %}
  {% assign ep = edgepad | default: 0 %}
  {% assign sx = 3 %}
  {% assign ex = 97 %}
  {% assign xscale = 1.0 %}
  {% assign leadx = 0 %}
  {% assign tailx = 100 %}
  {% if ep > 0 %}
    {% assign sx = ep %}
    {% assign ex = 100 | minus: ep %}
    {% assign innerw = 100 | minus: ep | minus: ep %}
    {% assign xscale = innerw | divided_by: 100.0 %}
    {% assign leadx = 0 | minus: ep | divided_by: xscale %}
    {% assign tailx = 100 | minus: ep | divided_by: xscale %}
  {% endif %}
  {% assign cy = 4.4 %}
  {% assign ly = cy | plus: cr | plus: 0.4 %}
  {% assign dyv = cf | times: 0.35 %}
  {%- comment -%} ink = silhouette + connector colour (#000 default). card = dithered rounded
    background, light gray everywhere by default. A solid ink strip runs along the bottom so flat
    stages read as a clean line; it carries the 0 km / total km markers in white. Climb + sprint
    circles stay white-fill / black-text so they read on the card. km = total stage distance. {%- endcomment -%}
  {% assign ink = ink | default: '#000' %}
  {% assign card = card | default: 'bg--gray-75' %}
  {% if card and card != '' %}<div class="{{ card }} rounded--large overflow--hidden pt--1{% if sw and sw != 0 %} flex flex--col flex--center-x{% else %} text--center{% endif %}">{% endif %}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 100 38" preserveAspectRatio="none" font-size="1"{% if sw and sw != 0 %} height="{{ h | default: 152 }}" width="{{ sw }}"{% else %} class="w--full"{% endif %}>
    {%- comment -%} silhouette baseline sits on the strip top (y=33) so the ink strip is fully UNDER
      the route, never overlapping its low parts. On inset variants the real route is remapped into
      sx..ex, while leadx/tailx extend its baseline back to the card edges. This avoids the apparent
      vertical crop at both rounded edges without shrinking the edge-to-edge distance strip. {%- endcomment -%}
    {% if path and path != '' %}
      <g transform="translate({{ ep }},12.67) scale({{ xscale }},0.535)">
        <polygon points="{{ leadx }},38 {{ path }} {{ tailx }},38" fill="{{ ink }}"></polygon>
      </g>
    {% else %}
      <text x="50" y="19" text-anchor="middle" font-size="5" font-weight="bold" fill="#000">PROFILE PENDING</text>
    {% endif %}
    {%- comment -%} bottom ink strip + distance markers (0 km left, total km right, in white) {%- endcomment -%}
    <rect x="0" y="33" width="100" height="5" fill="{{ ink }}"></rect>
    <text transform="translate({{ sx }},36.7) scale(3)" fill="#fff" style="font-family:'NicoClean','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif">0 km</text>
    {% if km and km != '' %}<text transform="translate({{ ex }},36.7) scale(3)" fill="#fff" text-anchor="end" style="font-family:'NicoClean','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif">{{ km }}</text>{% endif %}
    {% for c in climbs %}
      {% assign cp = c | split: '|||' %}
      {%- comment -%} cdx = spread-out circle x (field 6); the elbow connector still points to the TRUE x (field 1).
        jy steps up per climb so neighbouring corners don't merge into one horizontal line {%- endcomment -%}
      {% assign cdx = cp[6] | default: cp[1] | plus: 0 %}
      {% if ep > 0 and cdx < ep %}{% assign cdx = ep %}{% endif %}
      {% if ep > 0 and cdx > ex %}{% assign cdx = ex %}{% endif %}
      {% assign truex = cp[1] | plus: 0 | times: xscale | plus: ep %}
      {% assign jstep = forloop.index0 | times: 1.0 %}
      {% assign jy = 12.6 | minus: jstep %}
      {% if jy < 9.0 %}{% assign jy = 9.0 %}{% endif %}
      <polyline points="{{ cdx }},{{ ly }} {{ cdx }},{{ jy }} {{ truex }},{{ jy }} {{ truex }},33" fill="none" stroke="{{ ink }}" stroke-width="0.3" stroke-dasharray="1,1"></polyline>
      <circle cx="{{ cdx }}" cy="{{ cy }}" r="{{ cr }}" fill="#fff" stroke="#000" stroke-width="0.5"></circle>
      <text transform="translate({{ cdx }},{{ cy }}) scale({{ cf }})" dy="0.35" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000" style="font-family:'NicoClean','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif">{{ cp[0] }}</text>
    {% endfor %}
  </svg>
  {% if card and card != '' %}</div>{% endif %}
{% endtemplate %}

{%- comment -%} rest_graphic — REST DAY stand-in for the stage profile, drawn in the SAME card style
  (light gray dithered card, edge-to-edge, black baseline strip). Crescent moon + Zzz on the gray,
  grounded on the strip. Same 100x38 viewBox / fixedw+h as stage_profile so it slots in identically. {%- endcomment -%}
{% template rest_graphic %}
  {% assign sw = fixedw | default: 0 %}
  <div class="bg--gray-75 rounded--large overflow--hidden pt--1{% if sw and sw != 0 %} flex flex--col flex--center-x{% else %} text--center{% endif %}">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 38" preserveAspectRatio="none" font-size="1"{% if sw and sw != 0 %} height="{{ h | default: 152 }}" width="{{ sw }}"{% else %} class="w--full"{% endif %}>
      <circle cx="9" cy="8" r="0.5" fill="#000"></circle>
      <circle cx="36" cy="6" r="0.5" fill="#000"></circle>
      <circle cx="15" cy="18" r="0.4" fill="#000"></circle>
      {%- comment -%} crescent via mask (the bite shows the card through — no white-disc artifact).
        id MUST be unique per render: rest_graphic appears twice in full (OG + X-landscape) and a
        shared id resolves to the hidden instance's mask, breaking the visible moon. {%- endcomment -%}
      <mask id="moon_g{{ sw }}"><circle cx="22" cy="13" r="6.5" fill="#fff"></circle><circle cx="25" cy="10.5" r="5.7" fill="#000"></circle></mask>
      <circle cx="22" cy="13" r="6.5" fill="#000" mask="url(#moon_g{{ sw }})"></circle>
      <text transform="translate(62,29) scale(8)" font-weight="bold" fill="#000" style="font-family:'NicoClean','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif">z</text>
      <text transform="translate(71,22) scale(11)" font-weight="bold" fill="#000" style="font-family:'NicoClean','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif">z</text>
      <text transform="translate(81,14) scale(15)" font-weight="bold" fill="#000" style="font-family:'NicoClean','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif">Z</text>
      <rect x="0" y="33" width="100" height="5" fill="#000"></rect>
    </svg>
  </div>
{% endtemplate %}

{%- comment -%} rest_banner — wide-flat REST DAY variant (X portrait), same card style, 280x27 viewBox. {%- endcomment -%}
{% template rest_banner %}
